    "name": "Shaper",
    "steam_appid": 2181840,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "\u300aShaper\u300b is a voxel sandbox game in which terrain and creatures are randomly generated,<br />\r\nThe blocks that build the terrain will have rich shape changes, and the blocks can be destroyed and placed freely.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow to play the game: Creatures will be randomly generated around the terrain. Defeat the creatures to obtain food and materials to help the character survive and develop.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBlock building is one of the main playing methods of the game. Collect enough block materials to build distinctive buildings.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe collected squares can be used to synthesize items. Bows, swords and other weapons can be obtained through synthesis to improve combat effectiveness.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSome building structures will be randomly generated along with the terrain, and players can explore and obtain the treasures therein.",
    "about_the_game": "\u300aShaper\u300b is a voxel sandbox game in which terrain and creatures are randomly generated,<br />\r\nThe blocks that build the terrain will have rich shape changes, and the blocks can be destroyed and placed freely.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow to play the game: Creatures will be randomly generated around the terrain. Defeat the creatures to obtain food and materials to help the character survive and develop.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBlock building is one of the main playing methods of the game. Collect enough block materials to build distinctive buildings.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe collected squares can be used to synthesize items. Bows, swords and other weapons can be obtained through synthesis to improve combat effectiveness.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSome building structures will be randomly generated along with the terrain, and players can explore and obtain the treasures therein.",
    "short_description": "\u300aShaper\u300b is a sandbox building exploration game. Defeat enemies and monsters by collecting square materials to synthesize tools and equipment. Build unique buildings to survive and develop in this fantastic world.",
    "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese, English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Russian, Bulgarian, Hungarian, Greek, Czech, Japanese, Polish, Thai, Swedish, Traditional Chinese, Romanian, Finnish, Dutch, Portuguese - Portugal, Vietnamese, Arabic, Korean",
